  "scenario": "Set the transmit interrupt interval to 8 and leave RX interrupt policy at default. Compare short IPv4 streams to default. Run 512 individual 512-byte UDP request/echo pairs and an additional single datagram.",
  "expected": "Reduce transmit interrupt rate with comparable IPv4 transmit throughput. Observe completion of the final packet and the queue idle state.",
  "observed": "TCP transmit was 936.90 Mbit/s at default and 933.62 Mbit/s at interval 8. EQOS interrupts decreased from about 79,523 to 27,296 per second. All 512 echo pairs and the single datagram completed. A local queue sample reported zero outstanding TX descriptors after both runs.",
